      "title": "CPU vs request",
      "description": "CPU usage of each Kyverno controller pod divided by its CPU request. The controllers deliberately have no CPU limit (see the Kyverno HelmRelease), so values above 100% are allowed: the pod uses more than it reserved. Lines mark 100% and 200%.",
